# 🧬 ctDNA Pipeline for Triple-Negative Breast Cancer Detection

**🏆 1st Place — Bioinformatics Challenge 2026 (biotechnology.sy)**

## 📌 Overview
End-to-end bioinformatics pipeline for liquid biopsy (ctDNA) analysis to extract SNVs/CNVs and identify a diagnostic gene panel for early breast cancer detection.

## 🛠️ Tools
- **Languages:** Python
- **Approach:** AI-assisted coding (Qwen) + rigorous biological validation
- **Reproducibility:** GitHub version-controlled workflows

## 📂 Structure
- `scripts/` — Step-by-step analysis code
- `results/` — Gene panels and variant summaries

## 🔬 Goal
Prioritize clinically relevant mutations for early diagnostic applications.

